# The Yaycay back-end contract is published to GitHub Packages under the
# @alkazat scope. This maps that scope to the right registry. Auth (a
# read:packages token) is supplied at install time via the NODE_AUTH_TOKEN env
# var - never commit a token here.
#
# Local:  export NODE_AUTH_TOKEN=ghp_xxx  (or add a ~/.npmrc auth line)
# CI:     set a PACKAGES_TOKEN secret and write the auth line before `npm ci`
#
# No @alkazat/* package is a dependency yet, so this line is inert until the
# contract package is installed.
@alkazat:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
